# GitHub contribution skyline (Community page)
#
# To show your REAL, live GitHub contribution graph, copy this file to
# `.env.local` and fill both values. Without them, the site falls back to a
# generated sample year so nothing breaks.
#
# 1) GITHUB_USERNAME — the GitHub login whose contributions to display.
GITHUB_USERNAME=k4ran909
#
# 2) GITHUB_TOKEN — a Personal Access Token. The contributions GraphQL query
#    requires auth. A classic token with the `read:user` scope (or a
#    fine-grained token with read-only "Profile" access) is enough; no repo
#    scope is needed for public contribution counts.
#    Create one at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
GITHUB_TOKEN=
